endo anche il nuovo paese da scoprire, in 70 giorni.","tagline":"L'avventura sta andando fuori mappa!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Around the World in 80 Days","overview":"Passepartout, a bookish young marmoset, always dreams of becoming an explorer. One day, he crosses paths with Phileas, a reckless and greedy frog, eager to take on a bet to circumnavigate the globe in 80 days and earn 10 million clams in the process. Seizing the opportunity of a lifetime to explore the world, Passepartout embarks with his new friend on a crazy and exhilarating adventure full of twists and surprises.","tagline":"Adventure is heading off the map!"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Passepartout, un ouistiti naïf mais plein d’entrain, rêve de partir à l’aventure depuis toujours. L’occasion se présente sous la forme de Phileas Frog, un explorateur vanneur et arnaqueur, et d’un pari à plusieurs millions : établir le nouveau record du tour du monde en 80 jours. De déserts brûlants en jungles mystérieuses, de princesses intrépides en criquets adorateurs de volcans, Passepartout va découvrir à quel point le monde est vaste, merveilleux et dingo.","tagline":"C'est parti mon ouistiti !"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ciFOoNiq7pVBPdR88nBeXN0b00H.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ghSMYISXNxjduDuvzYoPYOI3yRk.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":753601,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ciFOoNiq7pVBPdR88nBeXN0b00H.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ciFOoNiq7pVBPdR88nBeXN0b00H.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ciFOoNiq7pVBPdR88nBeXN0b00H.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ciFOoNiq7pVBPdR88nBeXN0b00H.jpg","lang